  "row": {
    "id": "OBS-20261020-T31-VERIFIED-CANDIDATE-RETAIN",
    "kind": "exact candidate activation and retained deployment with explicitly reused visual evidence",
    "name": "T31 retains the verified video candidate on 5cd with fresh identity and feed",
    "status": "EXACT_5CD_CANDIDATE_RETAINED; SCOPED_VIDEO_DEMO_SIGNOFF_RECORDED; TWO_SAME_CLIP_VISUAL_CYCLES_REUSED; MANUAL_AUDIO_USER_CONFIRMED_CLIP_UNSPECIFIED; FRESH_SIX_STATES_AND_FIVE_SLOTS_MATCH; TRUE_FEED; NO_NEW_PUBLIC_API_FREEZE",
    "method": "Reuse the exact T30 two-TU resource-free Request recovery shim7f8d75bb (107544 bytes) with T29 bridgeb0e5602a (2023136 bytes), retaining the original six-artifact executor. The separate t4 activation contract explicitly reuses replay02 two same-clip play/pause/resume cycles and normal icon/feed exits. Activation performs a fresh apply, boot, six physical/private state check, five actual slot reads, normal icon and real feed verification, then signs retention in this window. No new build or replay cycle is implied.",
    "platform": "5cd only; activation boot13e5b7eb-5e98-40a8-9086-a25a4a32f2d6, parent5824/b9818, host5659/b9595, child7669/b11062, parent namespace4026532996. Exact matching six-artifact candidate; recovery remains bound to the current apply-plan and original backups.",
    "apps": "Toutiao: reused replay02 has two complete visual cycles of the same clip, including changing play/resume frames and stationary pause frames. User stated manual video opening works and has sound; title and per-cycle audio were unspecified. This activation ends at the actual recommendation feed (56bfa936…), personally viewed by this reviewer.",
    "limitations": "This is not two distinct clips, per-title/per-cycle sound confirmation, an all-video guarantee, crash elimination, or a new verified public Android API. The activation does not relabel reused cycles as new observations. Replay02 missed its retention signature deadline and restored original runtime; its unknown identity/audio fields and prior failure records remain unchanged. T30 first40601000 cause and subsequent Q/F on the same failed objects remain unknown/unobserved. Cold icon initially showed the host page before feed; host-transition improvement is deferred. Snapshot-based visual cycles do not prove uninterrupted playback between samples. Origin backups were checked by actual apply guards, not reread after reboot. Compat absent-marker owner/label was not independently observed. Recovery requires the verified live parent/WID29, preserved original backups and current origin scoped admission; no claim of arbitrary-state recovery.",
    "deployment": "Outer signed retain-decision3ab33271fc57e2081eb082748ebadefc8dc9632c54525c3734e92a04ac7be8b4 at590.841514 seconds; closed at608.564982 seconds with candidate retained, unlockrc0 and held-afterrc1 empty. Temporary power timeout/override restored to10000/10000 and debug parameter absent err106. Candidate runtime is intentionally retained rather than rolled back; original per-window backups and recovery ownership remain available. Activation archive156b38f3c1963c18f85b512a7b983a5b0005790e66abb4c4a0517cbb8101d585 is remotely verified (13231139 bytes,5128 members), alongside the required replay02 archiveb1713358 (10147220 bytes,13673 members). The original signed decision final_archive=null remains historical; this later receipt is separate evidence. The separate outer final-signoff5052bf3f records SEALED_SCOPED_TOUTIAO_VIDEO_DEMO_5CD and binds archiveR156b38f3 after retention without rewriting the original decision. This scoped demo signoff does not freeze a public API or guarantee all videos.",
